   Name           proof
   Font set       proof
   Size           automatic, from vtium.conf. vtium-config offers its usual sizes, because it
                  cannot yet ask the font helper which sizes these fonts supply.
   Color scheme   legacy, from vtium.conf
   Vtlook         sepia
   Pointer theme  vtium's own pictures, from vtium.conf. A look cannot pick a pointer theme of its
                  own yet.

 Enter on a line shows its choices, and Left and Right step through them. Each change waits for
 Save. Esc goes back to the list and keeps the changes.
 Its fonts, by role:
 Text: font:JetBrains Mono
 Box drawing: vtium's own lines and blocks
 What it still misses:
 Not known yet: the font helper has not checked its fonts.









